{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/4f2603413098937a5d083056c73d3525.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=100 /></span>Your lost curious kitten has wandered into a dark, creepy, mysterious crypt... a tomb that belongs to a coven of pirates, where through their mortal years they have amassed a huge bounty of jewels, gems and ancient coins. Now centuries later, and long since dead, they lay buried with their treasure. But understanding the nature of thieves and determined to keep their loot, even in death, they have summoned the spirits of the &quot;shadow world&quot; to govern and protect this crypt from the very bandits they once were.     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/129a8efebc96ca907c2921ffddadb1a6.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/d54910f1fbfafee4e8977f5d40e6a4b6.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9b59632e69fd53f63051202e2de91064.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>They built this crypt as both temple and prison. Legends say a ritual went wrong: instead of summoning the entity, they trapped it here, sealed beneath stone and sigil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/9eedf836cf248591fd176ea105bb7ea0.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, the crypt faded into obscurity, whispered only in fragments:<br>\u00a0<br><i>\u201cA treasure greater than any king\u2019s ransom lies within.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cNo soul returns once the silence begins to whisper.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe stones themselves hunger.\u201d</i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0ca7a9b3c8898d0d8cc5afa031819d31.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i>   <br>    <br>  This crypt contains so much treasure and gold buried deep below that a mine cart system was built in an effort to extract it to the surface... however the greedy miners may have under-estimated the ghostly\u00a0inhabitants. Get ready for a wild cart ride that can lead you off the rails to the darkest of chasms should you not switch tracks quickly enough.    <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/b0c85da87d47b44dbebf640fa87912fd.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Edge of Evil</strong> is a horror experience that will take you deep below, through dark twisted passages and into the depths of a long forgotten locked crypt in search of answers to an ancient seal that has been broken, unleashing a powerful presence from the mysterious <strong><i>&quot;Black World&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0 \u00a0<br> \u00a0\u00a0<br>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/bee0fe02a5d5c8227c5bfe9d15469152.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>     <br><strong> </strong>     <br><strong>A Truly</strong>\u00a0<strong>Haunting Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and immersive sounds as well as a minimal user interface ensure a totally visceral horror experience; forcing you to continuously question your own senses... just beyond, and right up to the <strong><i>edge.</i></strong>.. <br><br><br>- Realistic Graphics        <br>- Immersive Sound And Music       <br>- Eerie Ambience And Atmosphere       <br>- Intriguing Mystery To Solve<br>- Interesting Characters <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/0217d9ec3f58cb313c702a6cef0a440a.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Does digging up graves sound like fun?  You would be surprised what you can find buried in this crypt... treasure, secret passages and a dark hidden past. But don't dig too deep or you might uncover something that probably should stay buried.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.poster.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.webm?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/89625a4739f224862de10e10f1d87011.mp4?t=1774449069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/f18408b0e956cf1be386528de696b6eb.avif?t=1774449069\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/3c44dfae3b10ee67390fdb65116006ca.avif?t=1774449069\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>Here's what a few YouTubers and Streamers are saying about the demo...<br>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><br><i><strong>&quot;Wow! Amazing demo! Very scary...very creepy. I liked the ambience... it messes with your head from the very beginning.&quot;</strong></i>-RadicalFoil1796<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Very, very good! I really enjoyed this game... I am wishlisting this right now. I need this in my life!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0- ReAnimateHer <br> <br>&quot;<i><strong>That was cool... creepy and mysterious demo. I enjoy that!&quot;</strong></i>\u00a0-Lady Boomin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;I am looking forward to playing this when the full version comes out. We will 100% play this when it comes out.&quot;</i></strong> - Dr. Ravenholm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;This really surprised me... It has way more quality than I expected. The ambience is amazing!&quot;</i></strong> -Damyan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;I wanted to play some more!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0-Duffin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;I thought this was fun... I might have to pick this up and save the kitty!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0-LonePC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;Wow! I'm intrigued. Looking forward to the full game release!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0-AlakiBuffs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;So Fire! Lets go! What a cool demo!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0-Dracul    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><br><br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\u00a0<i><strong>STOP READING this and get in there and help find &quot;Lil Nightshade&quot;</strong></i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928510?t=1774449069","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928510?t=1774449069","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/5ba393bef85474f1ff9b6cae51ee02e5d3325f63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774449069","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/5ba393bef85474f1ff9b6cae51ee02e5d3325f63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774449069","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4209340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/extras/4f2603413098937a5d083056c73d3525.avif?t=1774449069\" width=800 height=1