<br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;I thought this was fun... I might have to pick this up and save the kitty!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0-LonePC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;Wow! I'm intrigued. Looking forward to the full game release!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0-AlakiBuffs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;So Fire! Lets go! What a cool demo!&quot;</i></strong>\u00a0-Dracul    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><br><br>&gt;&gt;&gt;\u00a0<i><strong>STOP READING this and get in there and help find &quot;Lil Nightshade&quot;</strong></i></h2>","developers":["WRF Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928510/59cdc55f04c4af66f17f9474f10dadeb5f813265/header.jpg?t=1774449069","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Edge Of Evil is the registered trademark of WRF Studios - Copyrighted 2025 - All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3928510/276286110/85d4b2cdd87b4feda097300a119e46cb8d8c7497/1772314469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772315085","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3928510/276286110/85d4b2cdd87b4feda097300a119e46cb8d8c7497/1772314469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772315085","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3928510/276286110/85d4b2cdd87b4feda097300a119e46cb8d8c7497/1772314469/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772315085","id":257296044,"name":"gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.a